#: lib/tymeslot/emails/templates/account_deletion_notice.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your upcoming bookings have been deleted from Tymeslot. Your guests were not notified. Calendar events and video links that already exist have been left as they are. If a meeting will not take place, please contact your guests yourself."
msgstr "Tus próximas reservas se eliminaron de Tymeslot. No se avisó a tus invitados. Los eventos de calendario y los enlaces de video que ya existen quedaron como estaban. Si una reunión no se va a realizar, comunícate tú con tus invitados."

#: lib/tymeslot/emails/templates/account_deletion_notice.ex
